WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.520
Meerko is the outbound engine for your AI agent.

00:00:03.904 --> 00:00:06.320
Tell Claude or ChatGPT who you sell to.

00:00:06.544 --> 00:00:11.120
Meerko finds the people, then finds and verifies their work emails.

00:00:11.456 --> 00:00:15.280
Your agent writes a short sequence, and Meerko sends it from your own inbox.

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:17.840
Nothing goes out until you approve.

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:24.799
When someone replies, even at two in the morning, Meerko wakes your agent, and its draft waits for your OK.

00:00:25.023 --> 00:00:26.160
Meerko.

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:28.799
Open source, and free to start.
